     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We hope you've found our recent recommendations valuable and are considering how these products can enhance your practice. At <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>, our mission is to support you in delivering the highest quality care to your patients.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We understand that every practice is unique, which is why we\u2019d love to offer you a <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>free consultation</strong></a> with one of our experts. During this consultation, we can:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Discuss Your Practice Needs:</strong> Whether you\u2019re focusing on spinal health, joint support, overall wellness, or any other area, we can help you identify the best product solutions for your specific goals.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Explore Product Integration:</strong> Learn how to effectively incorporate our products into your existing treatment plans to maximize patient outcomes.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Answer Any Questions:</strong> If you have any lingering questions about our products or how they can benefit your patients, now is the perfect time to ask.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Why Schedule a Consultation?</strong></span><br>Our consultations are designed to provide you with valuable insights and advice that you can immediately apply in your practice.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Whether you\u2019re looking to address specific patient concerns or expand your product offerings, we\u2019re here to support you every step of the way.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Don\u2019t miss this opportunity to elevate your practice with expert guidance. Click the link below to schedule your consultation at a time that works best for you:</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
